      "a": "wer:\n(c) a positive change in quality\n(ii) Which one of the following scholars introduced the concept of Human Development?\n(a) Prof. Amartya Sen\n(b) Ellen C. Semple\n(c) Dr Mahabub-ul-Haq\n(d) Ratzel\nAnswer:\n(c) Dr Mahabub-ul-Haq"
