      "q": "2. Answer the following questions in about 30 words.\n(i) Which activity does transportation convey? Name three major modes of transportation.\nTransportation conveys the movement of goods, people, and commodities from one place to another.\nThe three major modes of transportation are:\nLand transport (roads and railways)\nWater transport (inland and oceanic)\nAir transport (airways)\n(ii) Discuss advantages and disadvantages of pipeline transportation.\nPipelines are very efficient for transporting liquids and gases over long distances, require less energy, and reduce road and rail congestion.\nHowever, they have high initial construction costs, are suitable only for specific goods, and any leakage may cause wastage or environmental harm.\n(iii) What do you mean by \u2018communication\u2019?\nCommunication is the process of exchanging ideas, information, views, and messages from one place or person to another, using various methods such as oral, written, electronic, or satellite-based systems.",
